{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20796","headline":"门箴 · 卢仝","name":"门箴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贪残奸酗，狡佞讦愎。\n身之八杀，背惠，恃己。\n狎不肖，妬贤能。\n命之四孽，有是有此予敢辞。\n无是无此予之师，一日不见予心思。\n思其人，惧其人。\n其交其难，敢告于门。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢仝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20796.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20796","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}